{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27307","headline":"前相国赞皇公早葺平泉山居蹔还憩旋起赴诏命作镇浙右輙抒怀赋四言诗十四首奉寄 九 · 裴潾","name":"前相国赞皇公早葺平泉山居蹔还憩旋起赴诏命作镇浙右輙抒怀赋四言诗十四首奉寄 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸟之在巢，风起林摇。\n退翔城颠，翠虬扪天。\n雨止雪旋，亦息于渊。\n人皆知进，我独止焉。\n人皆务明，我独晦焉。\n邈矣其山默矣其泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴潾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27307.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27307","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}